  "slug": "creamy-garlic-dip",
  "name": "Creamy Garlic Dip",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Creamy Garlic Dip is great with pretzels, chips, crackers and veggies. It tastes best when chilled overnight. Adjust the spices to taste. The recipe may be doubled.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a medium bowl, mix together sour cream, mayonnaise, garlic powder, crushed red pepper and dried parsley. Serve immediately or refrigerate overnight for full flavor."
    }
